950" end="24.080">st</span> <span begin="24.080" end="24.270">be</span> <span begin="24.270" end="24.620">frien</span><span begin="24.620" end="24.800">ds</span><span begin="24.800" end="24.890">,</span> <span begin="25.670" end="25.790">i</span><span begin="25.790" end="25.870">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="25.870" end="26.350">time</span> <span begin="26.350" end="26.550">to</span> <span begin="26.550" end="26.860">say</span> <span begin="26.860" end="27.090">good</span><span begin="27.090" end="27.490">bye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持朋友关系 是时候说再见了</span></p><p begin="27.530" end="31.280" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.530" end="27.700">Ju</span><span begin="27.700" end="27.820">st</span> <span begin="27.820" end="27.980">be</span> <span begin="27.980" end="28.420">frien</span><span begin="28.420" end="28.560">ds</span><span begin="28.560" end="28.630">,</span> <span begin="29.670" end="30.120">all</span> <span begin="30.120" end="30.340">we</span> <span begin="30.340" end="30.590">go</span><span begin="30.590" end="30.830">tta</span> <span begin="30.830" end="31.280">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持朋友关系 这是我们唯一能做的</span></p><p begin="31.280" end="34.630" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.280" end="31.460">Ju</span><span begin="31.460" end="31.570">st</span> <span begin="31.570" end="31.760">be</span> <span begin="31.760" end="32.100">frien</span><span begin="32.100" end="32.240">ds</span><span begin="32.240" end="32.310">,</span> <span begin="32.240" end="32.410">ju</span><span begin="32.410" end="32.500">st</span> <span begin="32.500" end="32.700">be</span> <span begin="32.700" end="33.110">frien</span><span begin="33.110" end="33.200">ds</span><span begin="33.200" end="33.250">,</span> <span begin="33.200" end="33.330">ju</span><span begin="33.330" end="33.430">st</span> <span begin="33.430" end="33.630">be</span> <span begin="33.630" end="34.130">frien</span><span begin="34.130" end="34.330">ds</span><span begin="34.330" end="34.630">...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持朋友关系……</span></p></div><div begin="35.630" end="1:05.150" itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="35.630" end="39.180" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.630" end="35.760">浮</span><span begin="35.760" end="35.920">か</span><span begin="35.920" end="36.040">ん</span><span begin="36.040" end="36.230">だ</span><span begin="36.230" end="36.370">ん</span><span begin="36.370" end="36.660">だ</span> <span begin="36.660" end="36.900">昨</span><span begin="36.900" end="37.290">日</span><span begin="37.290" end="37.620">の</span><span begin="37.620" end="38.090">朝</span> <span begin="38.090" end="38.550">早</span><span begin="38.550" end="38.850">く</span><span begin="38.850" end="39.180">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脑中浮现 昨天一大早</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It came to mind in the early morning yesterday</span></p><p begin="39.490" end="42.990" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.490" end="39.730">割</span><span begin="39.730" end="39.970">れ</span><span begin="39.970" end="40.080">た</span><span begin="40.080" end="40.410">グ</span><span begin="40.410" end="40.570">ラ</span><span begin="40.570" end="40.910">ス</span> <span begin="40.910" end="41.030">か</span><span begin="41.030" end="41.360">き</span><span begin="41.360" end="41.820">集</span><span begin="41.820" end="41.980">め</span><span begin="41.980" end="42.290">る</span><span begin="42.290" end="42.540">よう</span><span begin="42.540" end="42.990">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好像是在收拾打破的玻璃碎片的情景</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As if I gathered broken pieces of glass</span></p><p begin="43.180" end="44.540" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.180" end="43.270">こ</span><span begin="43.270" end="43.410">れ</span><span begin="43.410" end="43.580">は</span><span begin="43.580" end="43.760">一</span><span begin="43.760" end="44.000">体</span><span begin="44.000" end="44.180">な</span><span begin="44.180" end="44.230">ん</span><span begin="44.230" end="44.330">だ</span><span begin="44.330" end="44.540">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这到底是什么情况？ 被割伤的手指滴下了血滴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">What the heck is this?</span></p><p begin="44.540" end="46.400" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.540" end="44.740">切</span><span begin="44.740" end="44.810">っ</span><span begin="44.810" end="44.950">た</span><span begin="44.950" end="45.160">指</span><span begin="45.160" end="45.290">か</span><span begin="45.290" end="45.370">ら</span><span begin="45.370" end="45.500">し</span><span begin="45.500" end="45.630">た</span><span begin="45.630" end="45.740">た</span><span begin="45.740" end="45.830">る</span><span begin="45.830" end="46.400">滴</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A drop from a cut on my finger</span></p><p begin="46.540" end="48.270" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.540" end="47.010">僕</span><span begin="47.010" end="47.150">ら</span><span begin="47.150" end="47.380">は</span><span begin="47.480" end="47.560">こ</span><span begin="47.560" end="47.730">ん</span><span begin="47.730" end="47.950">な</span><span begin="47.950" end="48.080">こ</span><span begin="48.080" end="48.270">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们真的干了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Is this what we</span></p><p begin="48.280" end="50.100" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.280" end="48.430">し</span><span begin="48.430" end="48.550">た</span><span begin="48.550" end="48.800">か</span><span begin="48.800" end="48.900">っ</span><span begin="48.900" end="49.120">た</span><span begin="49.120" end="49.320">の</span><span begin="49.320" end="49.610">か</span><span begin="49.610" end="50.100">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种蠢事吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Really hoped for?</span></p><p begin="50.660" end="54.250" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.660" end="50.760">分</span><span begin="50.760" end="50.940">か</span><span begin="50.940" end="51.020">っ</span><span begin="51.020" end="51.230">て</span><span begin="51.230" end="51.350">た</span><span begin="51.350" end="51.690">よ</span> <span begin="51.690" end="52.320">心</span><span begin="52.320" end="52.630">の</span><span begin="52.630" end="53.040">奥</span><span begin="53.040" end="53.590">底</span><span begin="53.590" end="53.800">で</span><span begin="53.800" end="54.250">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很清楚 在心底深处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I knew it at the bottom of my heart</span></p><p begin="54.500" end="57.830" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.500" end="55.120">最</span><span begin="55.120" end="55.370">も</span><span begin="55.370" end="55.870">辛</span><span begin="55.870" end="55.950">い</span> <span begin="55.950" end="56.390">選</span><span begin="56.390" end="56.850">択</span><span begin="56.850" end="56.990">が</span><span begin="56.990" end="57.240">ベ</span><span begin="57.240" end="57.570">ス</span><span begin="57.570" end="57.830">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最难过的选择才是最佳答案</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That the hardest choice would be the best</span></p><p begin="58.060" end="59.510" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.060" end="58.270">そ</span><span begin="58.270" end="58.380">れ</span><span begin="58.380" end="58.520">を</span><span begin="58.520" end="58.730">拒</span><span begin="58.730" end="58.860">む</span><span begin="58.860" end="58.990">自</span><span begin="58.990" end="59.110">己</span><span begin="59.110" end="59.330">愛</span><span begin="59.330" end="59.510">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断抗拒的是自我保护</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">My self-love refuses it</span></p><p begin="59.560" end="1:01.420" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.560" end="59.810">結</span><span begin="59.810" end="59.930">果</span><span begin="59.930" end="1:00.030">自</span><span begin="1:00.030" end="1:00.150">家</span><span begin="1:00.150" end="1:00.360">撞</span><span begin="1:00.360" end="1:00.610">着</span><span begin="1:00.610" end="1:00.730">の</span><span begin="1:00.730" end="1:00.840">繰</span><span begin="1:00.840" end="1:00.960">り</span><span begin="1:00.960" end="1:01.150">返</span><span begin="1:01.150" end="1:01.420">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和自我矛盾的无限循环</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And repeats self-contradiction</span></p><p begin="1:01.570" end="1:03.610" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.570" end="1:02.020">僕</span><span begin="1:02.020" end="1:02.280">は</span><span begin="1:02.280" end="1:02.440">い</span><span begin="1:02.440" end="1:02.620">つ</span><span begin="1:02.620" end="1:02.890">に</span><span begin="1:03.000" end="1:03.190">な</span><span begin="1:03.190" end="1:03.440">れ</span><span begin="1:03.440" end="1:03.610">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我什么时候</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When can I</span></p><p begin="1:03.640" end="1:05.150" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.640" end="1:03.730">言</span><span begin="1:03.730" end="1:03.920">え</span><span begin="1:03.920" end="1:04.120">る</span><span begin="1:04.120" end="1:04.340">の</span><span begin="1:04.340" end="1:04.600">か</span><span begin="1:04.600" end="1:05.150">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才说的出口呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Tell it to you?</span></p></div><div begin="1:05.710" end="1:19.530" itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="1:05.710" end="1:09.290" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.710" end="1:06.220">緩</span><span begin="1:06.220" end="1:06.350">や</span><span begin="1:06.350" end="1:06.700">か</span><span begin="1:06.700" end="1:06.890">に</span><span begin="1:06.890" end="1:07.130">朽</span><span begin="1:07.130" end="1:07.280">ち</span><span begin="1:07.280" end="1:07.560">て</span><span begin="1:07.560" end="1:07.630">ゆ</span><span begin="1:07.630" end="1:07.860">く</span><span begin="1:07.860" end="1:08.090">こ</span><span begin="1:08.090" end="1:08.180">の</span><span begin="1:08.180" end="1:08.560">世</span><span begin="1:08.560" end="1:09.060">界</span><span begin="1:09.060" end="1:09.290">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">慢慢腐朽的这个世界</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">In this slowly decaying world</span></p><p begin="1:09.450" end="1:12.570" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.450" end="1:09.960">足</span><span begin="1:09.960" end="1:10.110">掻</span><span begin="1:10.110" end="1:10.420">僕</span><span begin="1:10.420" end="1:10.660">の</span><span begin="1:10.870" end="1:11.140">唯</span><span begin="1:11.140" end="1:11.640">一</span><span begin="1:11.640" end="1:11.830">の</span><span begin="1:11.830" end="1:12.290">活</span><span begin="1:12.290" end="1:12.570">路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断挣扎的我只剩一条活路</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;m struggling but it&apos;s the only way</span></p><p begin="1:12.820" end="1:16.380" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.820" end="1:13.010">色</span><span begin="1:13.010" end="1:13.200">褪</span><span begin="1:13.200" end="1:13.490">せ</span><span begin="1:13.490" end="1:13.690">た</span><span begin="1:13.690" end="1:14.180">君</span><span begin="1:14.180" end="1:14.500">の</span> <span begin="1:14.650" end="1:15.160">微</span><span begin="1:15.160" end="1:15.350">笑</span><span begin="1:15.350" end="1:15.560">み</span><span begin="1:15.560" end="1:15.960">刻</span><span begin="1:15.960" end="1:16.040">ん</span><span begin="1:16.040" end="1:16.380">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你褪色的微笑 刻划在我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Carving your faded smiles</span></p><p begin="1:16.410" end="1:19.530" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.410" end="1:16.990">栓</span><span begin="1:16.990" end="1:17.290">を</span><span begin="1:17.440" end="1:17.980">抜</span><span begin="1:17.980" end="1:18.420">い</span><span begin="1:18.420" end="1:19.530">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后拔掉忍耐的栓子</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I pulled out the plug</span></p></div><div begin="1:19.780" end="1:52.510" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="1:19.780" end="1:22.910" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.780" end="1:20.290">声</span><span begin="1:20.290" end="1:20.510">を</span><span begin="1:20.510" end="1:20.940">枯</span><span begin="1:20.940" end="1:21.380">ら</span><span begin="1:21.380" end="1:21.700">し</span><span begin="1:21.700" end="1:21.870">て</span><span begin="1:21.870" end="1:22.400">叫</span><span begin="1:22.400" end="1:22.660">ん</span><span begin="1:22.660" end="1:22.910">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喊叫到声嘶力竭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I screamed with my hoarse voice</span></p><p begin="1:23.110" end="1:27.110" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.110" end="1:23.560">反</span><span begin="1:23.560" end="1:24.010">響</span> <span begin="1:24.010" end="1:24.510">残</span><span begin="1:24.510" end="1:24.930">響</span> <span begin="1:24.930" end="1:25.360">空</span><span begin="1:25.360" end="1:25.680">し</span><span begin="1:25.680" end="1:25.870">く</span><span begin="1:25.870" end="1:26.610">響</span><span begin="1:26.610" end="1:27.110">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反响 残响 空虚地响着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Rebound and resonance echo in vain</span></p><p begin="1:27.300" end="1:30.820" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.300" end="1:27.750">外</span><span begin="1:27.750" end="1:27.940">さ</span><span begin="1:27.940" end="1:28.250">れ</span><span begin="1:28.250" end="1:28.470">た</span><span begin="1:28.470" end="1:29.180">鎖</span><span begin="1:29.180" end="1:29.470">の</span> <span begin="1:29.620" end="1:29.900">そ</span><span begin="1:29.900" end="1:30.080">の</span><span begin="1:30.080" end="1:30.610">先</span><span begin="1:30.610" end="1:30.820">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算把锁给解开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Nothing is left behind at the end</span></p><p begin="1:31.080" end="1:34.630" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.080" end="1:31.320">な</span><span begin="1:31.320" end="1:31.520">に</span><span begin="1:31.520" end="1:31.690">ひ</span><span begin="1:31.690" end="1:31.980">と</span><span begin="1:31.980" end="1:32.250">つ</span><span begin="1:32.250" end="1:32.670">残</span><span begin="1:32.670" end="1:32.940">っ</span><span begin="1:32.940" end="1:33.180">て</span><span begin="1:33.180" end="1:33.370">や</span><span begin="1:33.370" end="1:33.640">し</span><span begin="1:33.640" end="1:33.930">な</span><span begin="1:33.930" end="1:34.110">い</span><span begin="1:34.110" end="1:34.380">け</span><span begin="1:34.380" end="1:34.630">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也什么都不会留下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Of the me that has been unchained</span></p><p begin="1:34.810" end="1:37.970" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.810" end="1:35.070">ふ</span><span begin="1:35.070" end="1:35.350">た</span><span begin="1:35.350" end="1:35.530">り</span><span begin="1:35.530" end="1:35.770">を</span><span begin="1:35.770" end="1:36.460">重</span><span begin="1:36.460" end="1:36.710">ね</span><span begin="1:36.710" end="1:36.930">て</span><span begin="1:36.930" end="1:37.190">た</span><span begin="1:37.190" end="1:37.620">偶</span><span begin="1:37.620" end="1:37.970">然</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人相遇的偶然</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The coincidences that we&apos;d piled up</span></p><p begin="1:38.140" end="1:42.050" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.140" end="1:38.560">暗</span><span begin="1:38.560" end="1:38.950">転</span> <span begin="1:39.060" end="1:39.450">断</span><span begin="1:39.450" end="1:39.840">線</span> <span begin="1:39.950" end="1:40.670">儚</span><span begin="1:40.670" end="1:40.880">く</span> <span begin="1:40.880" end="1:41.390">千</span><span begin="1:41.390" end="1:41.640">々</span><span begin="1:41.640" end="1:42.050">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暗转 断线 无尽虚幻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Degenerate into the dark and are broken in pieces</span></p><p begin="1:42.280" end="1:45.840" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.280" end="1:42.510">所</span><span begin="1:42.510" end="1:42.910">詮</span><span begin="1:42.910" end="1:43.260">こ</span><span begin="1:43.260" end="1:43.540">ん</span><span begin="1:43.540" end="1:43.750">な</span><span begin="1:43.750" end="1:43.860">も</span><span begin="1:43.860" end="1:44.100">の</span><span begin="1:44.100" end="1:44.410">さ</span> <span begin="1:44.650" end="1:45.410">呟</span><span begin="1:45.410" end="1:45.620">い</span><span begin="1:45.620" end="1:45.840">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“反正就是这样啦” 如此低语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">&quot;No matter what we do, life is just like that.&quot;</span></p><p begin="1:46.080" end="1:52.510" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.080" end="1:46.320">枯</span><span begin="1:46.320" end="1:46.540">れ</span><span begin="1:46.540" end="1:46.680">た</span><span begin="1:46.680" end="1:47.250">頬</span><span begin="1:47.250" end="1:47.450">に</span><span begin="1:47.450" end="1:47.970">伝</span><span begin="1:47.970" end="1:48.180">う</span><span begin="1:48.400" end="1:48.890">誰</span><span begin="1:48.890" end="1:49.130">か</span><span begin="1:49.130" end="1:49.390">の</span><span begin="1:49.390" end="1:52.510">涙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">流在毫无生气的脸庞上的 是谁的眼泪</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I mumbled as somebody&apos;s tears flow down the dried cheeks</span></p></div><div begin="1:52.190" end="2:04.790" itunes:song-part="Hook"><p begin="1:52.190" end="1:53.800" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.190" end="1:52.650">All</span> <span begin="1:52.650" end="1:52.890">we</span> <span begin="1:52.890" end="1:53.120">go</span><span begin="1:53.120" end="1:53.360">tta</span> <span begin="1:53.360" end="1:53.800">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是我们唯一能做的</span></p><p begin="1:53.800" end="1:57.540" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.800" end="1:53.960">Ju</span><span begin="1:53.960" end="1:54.060">st</span> <span begin="1:54.060" end="1:54.270">be</span> <span begin="1:54.270" end="1:54.650">frien</span><span begin="1:54.650" end="1:54.790">ds</span><span begin="1:54.790" end="1:54.860">,</span> <span begin="1:55.660" end="1:55.790">i</span><span begin="1:55.790" end="1:55.880">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:55.880" end="1:56.360">time</span> <span begin="1:56.360" end="1:56.520">to</span> <span begin="1:56.520" end="1:56.860">say</span> <span begin="1:56.860" end="1:57.090">good</span><span begin="1:57.090" end="1:57.540">bye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持朋友关系 是时候说再见了</span></p><p begin="1:57.560" end="2:01.300" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.560" end="1:57.720">Ju</span><span begin="1:57.720" end="1:57.820">st</span> <span begin="1:57.820" end="1:58.020">be</span> <span begin="1:58.020" end="1:58.400">frien</span><span begin="1:58.400" end="1:58.550">ds</span><span begin="1:58.550" end="1:58.630">,</span> <span begin="1:59.670" end="2:00.120">all</span> <span begin="2:00.120" end="2:00.380">we</span> <span begin="2:00.380" end="2:00.610">go</span><span begin="2:00.610" end="2:00.820">tta</span> <span begin="2:00.820" end="2:01.300">do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持朋友关系 这是我们唯一能做的</span></p><p begin="2:01.300" end="2:04.790" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.300" end="2:01.450">Ju</span><span begin="2:01.450" end="2:01.570">st</span> <span begin="2:01.570" end="2:01.780">be</span> <span begin="2:01.780" end="2:02.150">frien</span><span begin="2:02.150" end="2:02.260">ds</span><span begin="2:02.260" end="2:02.320">,</span> <span begin="2:02.260" end="2:02.380">ju</span><span begin="2:02.380" end="2:02.510">st</span> <span begin="2:02.510" end="2:02.710">be</span> <span begin="2:02.710" end="2:03.070">frien</span><span begin="2:03.070" end="2:03.190">ds</span><span begin="2:03.190" end="2:03.250">,</span> <span begin="2:03.190" end="2:03.300">ju</span><span begin="2:03.300" end="2:03.430">st</span> <span begin="2:03.430" end="2:03.650">be</span> <span begin="2:03.650" end="2:04.050">frien</span><span begin="2:04.050" end="2:04.340">ds</span><span begin="2:04.340" end="2:04.790">...</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持朋友关系 保持朋友关系 保持朋友关系……</span></p></div><div begin="2:05.660" end="2:35.340" itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="2:05.660" end="2:09.290" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.660" end="2:05.780">気</span><span begin="2:05.780" end="2:05.910">づ</span><span begin="2:05.910" end="2:06.000">い</span><span begin="2:06.000" end="2:06.310">た</span><span begin="2:06.310" end="2:06.400">ん</span><span begin="2:06.400" end="2:06.690">だ</span> <span begin="2:06.690" end="2:06.960">昨</span><span begin="2:06.960" end="2:07.320">日</span><span begin="2:07.320" end="2:07.610">の</span> <span begin="2:07.610" end="2:07.950">凪</span><span begin="2:07.950" end="2:08.120">い</span><span begin="2:08.120" end="2:08.260">だ</span><span begin="2:08.260" end="2:08.790">夜</span><span begin="2:08.790" end="2:09.290">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我才发现 在昨晚风雨停息过后</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Yesterday a tranquil night made me realize</span></p><p begin="2:09.520" end="2:13.000" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.520" end="2:09.700">落</span><span begin="2:09.700" end="2:09.960">ち</span><span begin="2:09.960" end="2:10.090">た</span><span begin="2:10.090" end="2:10.480">花</span><span begin="2:10.480" end="2:10.840">弁</span> <span begin="2:10.840" end="2:11.250">拾</span><span begin="2:11.250" end="2:11.420">い</span><span begin="2:11.420" end="2:11.640">上</span><span begin="2:11.640" end="2:11.880">げ</span><span begin="2:11.880" end="2:12.000">た</span><span begin="2:12.000" end="2:12.250">と</span><span begin="2:12.250" end="2:12.540">し</span><span begin="2:12.540" end="2:13.000">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算把掉在地上的花瓣给捡起来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;d be useless to pick up fallen petals</span></p><p begin="2:13.130" end="2:14.540" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.130" end="2:13.280">ま</span><span begin="2:13.280" end="2:13.370">た</span><span begin="2:13.370" end="2:13.510">咲</span><span begin="2:13.510" end="2:13.620">き</span><span begin="2:13.620" end="2:13.860">戻</span><span begin="2:13.860" end="2:13.990">る</span><span begin="2:13.990" end="2:14.110">こ</span><span begin="2:14.110" end="2:14.210">と</span><span begin="2:14.210" end="2:14.320">は</span><span begin="2:14.320" end="2:14.470">な</span><span begin="2:14.470" end="2:14.540">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它再也无法绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because it&apos;d never bloom again</span></p><p begin="2:14.540" end="2:16.420" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.540" end="2:14.800">そう</span><span begin="2:14.800" end="2:14.910">手</span><span begin="2:14.910" end="2:15.000">の</span><span begin="2:15.000" end="2:15.270">平</span><span begin="2:15.270" end="2:15.390">の</span><span begin="2:15.390" end="2:15.550">上</span><span begin="2:15.550" end="2:15.670">の</span><span begin="2:15.670" end="2:15.880">小</span><span begin="2:15.880" end="2:16.010">さ</span><span begin="2:16.010" end="2:16.110">な</span><span begin="2:16.110" end="2:16.420">死</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">掌心这微小的死亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s tiny but already dead on my palms</span></p><p begin="2:16.570" end="2:18.340" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.570" end="2:17.020">僕</span><span begin="2:17.020" end="2:17.150">ら</span><span begin="2:17.150" end="2:17.480">の</span><span begin="2:17.480" end="2:17.750">時</span><span begin="2:17.750" end="2:18.070">間</span><span begin="2:18.070" end="2:18.340">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们两人的时间</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Our time</span></p><p begin="2:18.450" end="2:20.120" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.450" end="2:18.670">止</span><span begin="2:18.670" end="2:18.840">ま</span><span begin="2:18.840" end="2:19.110">っ</span><span begin="2:19.110" end="2:19.340">た</span><span begin="2:19.340" end="2:19.620">ま</span><span begin="2:19.620" end="2:20.120">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此停滞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Stopped long ago</span></p><p begin="2:20.680" end="2:24.200" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.680" end="2:20.890">思</span><span begin="2:20.890" end="2:21.020">い</span><span begin="2:21.020" end="2:21.200">出</span><span begin="2:21.200" end="2:21.400">す</span><span begin="2:21.400" end="2:21.660">よ</span> <span begin="2:21.660" end="2:22.150">初</span><span begin="2:22.150" end="2:22.310">め</span><span begin="2:22.310" end="2:22.620">て</span><span begin="2:22.620" end="2:22.780">会</span><span begin="2:22.780" end="2:22.890">っ</span><span begin="2:22.890" end="2:23.080">た</span><span begin="2:23.080" end="2:23.220">季</span><span begin="2:23.220" end="2:23.830">節</span><span begin="2:23.830" end="2:24.200">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想起了 我们初次相遇的季节</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I remember the season we first met</span></p><p begin="2:24.490" end="2:27.950" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.490" end="2:24.970">君</span><span begin="2:24.970" end="2:25.110">の</span><span begin="2:25.110" end="2:25.630">優</span><span begin="2:25.630" end="2:25.920">し</span><span begin="2:25.920" end="2:26.040">く</span><span begin="2:26.040" end="2:26.600">微</span><span begin="2:26.600" end="2:26.820">笑</span><span begin="2:26.820" end="2:27.000">む</span><span begin="2:27.000" end="2:27.550">顔</span><span begin="2:27.550" end="2:27.950">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你那温柔笑着的脸庞</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And your graceful smile</span></p><p begin="2:28.140" end="2:29.540" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.140" end="2:28.400">今</span><span begin="2:28.400" end="2:28.470">を</span><span begin="2:28.470" end="2:28.590">過</span><span begin="2:28.590" end="2:28.730">去</span><span begin="2:28.730" end="2:28.830">に</span><span begin="2:28.830" end="2:28.910">押</span><span begin="2:28.910" end="2:29.080">し</span><span begin="2:29.080" end="2:29.260">や</span><span begin="2:29.260" end="2:29.350">っ</span><span begin="2:29.350" end="2:29.540">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就把现在变成过去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Bringing up old issues</span></p><p begin="2:29.540" end="2:31.370" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.540" end="2:29.780">二</span><span begin="2:29.780" end="2:29.890">人</span><span begin="2:29.890" end="2:30.140">傷</span><span begin="2:30.140" end="2:30.260">つ</span><span begin="2:30.260" end="2:30.370">く</span><span begin="2:30.370" end="2:30.630">限</span><span begin="2:30.630" end="2:30.720">り</span><span begin="2:30.720" end="2:30.940">傷</span><span begin="2:30.940" end="2:31.100">つ</span><span begin="2:31.100" end="2:31.210">い</span><span begin="2:31.210" end="2:31.370">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人遍体鳞伤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We hurt each other as badly as possible</span></p><p begin="2:31.530" end="2:33.400" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:31.530" end="2:32.020">僕</span><span begin="2:32.020" end="2:32.160">ら</span><span begin="2:32.160" end="2:32.470">の</span><span begin="2:32.470" end="2:33.160">心</span><span begin="2:33.160" end="2:33.400">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的内心已满是</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Our hearts are</span></p><p begin="2:33.410" end="2:35.340" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.410" end="2:33.870">棘</span><span begin="2:33.870" end="2:34.140">だ</span><span begin="2:34.140" end="2:34.350">ら</span><span begin="2:34.350" end="2:34.600">け</span><span begin="2:34.600" end="2:35.340">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">荆棘般的尖刺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Full of thorns</span></p></div><div begin="2:35.710" end="2:49.460" itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="2:35.710" end="2:39.350" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.710" end="2:36.230">重</span><span begin="2:36.230" end="2:36.650">苦</span><span begin="2:36.650" end="2:36.930">し</span><span begin="2:36.930" end="2:37.150">く</span><span begin="2:37.150" end="2:37.630">続</span><span begin="2:37.630" end="2:37.860">く</span><span begin="2:37.860" end="2:38.100">こ</span><span begin="2:38.100" end="2:38.210">の</span><span begin="2:38.210" end="2:38.550">関</span><span begin="2:38.550" end="2:39.060">係</span><span begin="2:39.060" end="2:39.350">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对沉重苦闷的这段感情</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">With this continuous dull relationship</span></p><p begin="2:39.500" end="2:42.680" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.500" end="2:39.930">悲</span><span begin="2:39.930" end="2:40.130">し</span><span begin="2:40.130" end="2:40.290">い</span><span begin="2:40.290" end="2:40.770">程</span> <span begin="2:40.930" end="2:41.040">変</span><span begin="2:41.040" end="2:41.170">わ</span><span begin="2:41.170" end="2:41.400">ら</span><span begin="2:41.400" end="2:41.620">な</span><span begin="2:41.620" end="2:41.850">い</span><span begin="2:41.850" end="2:42.680">心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人悲伤的是我这不曾变过的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Grievously I can&apos;t change my mind</span></p><p begin="2:42.830" end="2:46.340" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.830" end="2:43.010">愛</span><span begin="2:43.010" end="2:43.280">し</span><span begin="2:43.280" end="2:43.510">て</span><span begin="2:43.510" end="2:43.710">る</span><span begin="2:43.710" end="2:44.190">の</span><span begin="2:44.190" end="2:44.500">に</span> <span begin="2:44.650" end="2:44.910">離</span><span begin="2:44.910" end="2:45.150">れ</span><span begin="2:45.150" end="2:45.370">が</span><span begin="2:45.370" end="2:45.520">た</span><span begin="2:45.520" end="2:45.610">い</span><span begin="2:45.610" end="2:46.080">の</span><span begin="2:46.080" end="2:46.340">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明是如此深爱 没办法轻易分开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I still love you, I don&apos;t wanna be apart from you</span></p><p begin="2:46.560" end="2:49.460" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.560" end="2:47.000">僕</span><span begin="2:47.000" end="2:47.280">が</span><span begin="2:47.460" end="2:47.710">言</span><span begin="2:47.710" end="2:47.940">わ</span><span begin="2:47.940" end="2:48.230">な</span><span begin="2:48.360" end="2:49.460">きゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不说出口不行</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">But I have to tell you</span></p></div><div begin="2:49.820" end="3:22.450" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="2:49.820" end="2:52.960" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.820" end="2:50.540">心</span><span begin="2:50.540" end="2:50.770">に</span><span begin="2:50.770" end="2:50.890">土</span><span begin="2:50.890" end="2:51.480">砂</span><span begin="2:51.480" end="2:51.720">降</span><span begin="2:51.720" end="2:51.930">り</span><span begin="2:51.930" end="2:52.150">の</span><span begin="2:52.150" end="2:52.760">雨</span><span begin="2:52.760" end="2:52.960">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下在心里的倾盆大雨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s raining heavily in my mind, I&apos;m stunned,</span></p><p begin="2:53.110" end="2:57.090" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.110" end="2:53.530">呆</span><span begin="2:53.530" end="2:53.940">然</span> <span begin="2:53.940" end="2:54.500">竦</span><span begin="2:54.500" end="2:54.820">然</span> <span begin="2:54.930" end="2:55.110">視</span><span begin="2:55.110" end="2:55.680">界</span><span begin="2:55.680" end="2:55.870">も</span><span begin="2:55.870" end="2:56.650">煙</span><span begin="2:56.650" end="2:57.090">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呆然 竦然 让视线都模糊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;m standing dead, my vision is blurry</span></p><p begin="2:57.300" end="3:00.840" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.300" end="2:57.550">覚</span><span begin="2:57.550" end="2:57.920">悟</span><span begin="2:57.920" end="2:58.270">し</span><span begin="2:58.270" end="2:58.470">て</span><span begin="2:58.470" end="2:58.710">た</span><span begin="2:58.710" end="2:58.860">は</span><span begin="2:58.860" end="2:59.210">ず</span><span begin="2:59.210" end="2:59.430">の</span> <span begin="2:59.590" end="2:59.890">そ</span><span begin="2:59.890" end="3:00.160">の</span><span begin="3:00.160" end="3:00.630">痛</span><span begin="3:00.630" end="3:00.840">み</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽说早已做好觉悟 那份痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Despite my determination,</span></p><p begin="3:01.020" end="3:04.620" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:01.020" end="3:01.320">そ</span><span begin="3:01.320" end="3:01.540">れ</span><span begin="3:01.540" end="3:01.670">で</span><span begin="3:01.670" end="3:01.980">も</span><span begin="3:01.980" end="3:02.610">貫</span><span begin="3:02.610" end="3:02.940">か</span><span begin="3:02.940" end="3:03.190">れ</span><span begin="3:03.190" end="3:03.400">る</span><span begin="3:03.400" end="3:03.640">こ</span><span begin="3:03.640" end="3:03.880">の</span><span begin="3:03.880" end="3:04.620">体</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍贯穿了我的身体</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The pain is still penetrating</span></p><p begin="3:04.820" end="3:07.910" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:04.820" end="3:05.070">ふ</span><span begin="3:05.070" end="3:05.330">た</span><span begin="3:05.330" end="3:05.550">り</span><span begin="3:05.550" end="3:05.730">を</span><span begin="3:05.730" end="3:06.440">繋</span><span begin="3:06.440" end="3:06.720">い</span><span begin="3:06.720" end="3:06.930">で</span><span begin="3:06.930" end="3:07.150">た</span><span begin="3:07.150" end="3:07.910">絆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连结两人的羁绊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The bond between us had come apart</span></p><p begin="3:08.100" end="3:12.090" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:08.100" end="3:08.710">綻</span><span begin="3:08.710" end="3:08.900">び</span> <span begin="3:09.050" end="3:09.510">解</span><span begin="3:09.510" end="3:09.730">け</span> <span begin="3:09.730" end="3:10.100">日</span><span begin="3:10.100" end="3:10.700">常</span><span begin="3:10.700" end="3:10.870">に</span><span begin="3:10.870" end="3:11.060">消</span><span begin="3:11.060" end="3:11.380">え</span><span begin="3:11.380" end="3:11.600">て</span><span begin="3:11.600" end="3:12.090">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剪断 解开 消失在日常生活中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And is dying away in everyday</span></p><p begin="3:12.250" end="3:15.810" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.250" end="3:12.540">さ</span><span begin="3:12.540" end="3:12.790">よ</span><span begin="3:12.790" end="3:12.940">な</span><span begin="3:12.940" end="3:13.250">ら</span><span begin="3:13.250" end="3:13.460">愛</span><span begin="3:13.460" end="3:13.730">し</span><span begin="3:13.730" end="3:13.840">た</span><span begin="3:13.840" end="3:14.460">人</span> <span begin="3:14.660" end="3:14.880">こ</span><span begin="3:14.880" end="3:15.130">こ</span><span begin="3:15.130" end="3:15.370">ま</span><span begin="3:15.370" end="3:15.610">で</span><span begin="3:15.610" end="3:15.810">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见了曾深爱的人 到此为止了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Goodbye, my sweetheart, it&apos;s over</span></p><p begin="3:16.100" end="3:22.450" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.100" end="3:16.340">も</span><span begin="3:16.340" end="3:16.550">う</span><span begin="3:16.550" end="3:16.680">振</span><span begin="3:16.680" end="3:17.020">り</span><span begin="3:17.020" end="3:17.230">向</span><span begin="3:17.230" end="3:17.490">か</span><span begin="3:17.490" end="3:17.640">な</span><span begin="3:17.640" end="3:17.960">い</span><span begin="3:17.960" end="3:18.230">で</span><span begin="3:18.420" end="3:18.880">歩</span><span begin="3:18.880" end="3:19.160">き</span><span begin="3:19.160" end="3:19.300">出</span><span begin="3:19.300" end="3:19.840">す</span><span begin="3:19.840" end="3:20.290">ん</span><span begin="3:20.290" end="3:22.450">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再回头就向前走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We had to leave without turning back</span></p></div><div begin="3:35.750" end="3:52.570" itunes:song-part="Bridge"><p begin="3:35.750" end="3:38.810" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:35.750" end="3:36.020">一</span><span begin="3:36.020" end="3:36.260">度</span><span begin="3:36.260" end="3:36.460">だ</span><span begin="3:36.460" end="3:36.980">け</span> <span begin="3:37.190" end="3:37.390">一</span><span begin="3:37.390" end="3:37.670">度</span><span begin="3:37.670" end="3:37.840">だ</span><span begin="3:37.840" end="3:38.810">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次就好 一次就好</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just once, just once</span></p><p begin="3:39.470" end="3:43.020" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.470" end="3:40.020">願</span><span begin="3:40.020" end="3:40.200">い</span><span begin="3:40.200" end="3:40.680">が</span><span begin="3:40.900" end="3:41.160">叶</span><span begin="3:41.160" end="3:41.440">う</span><span begin="3:41.440" end="3:41.610">の</span><span begin="3:41.610" end="3:41.890">な</span><span begin="3:41.890" end="3:42.060">ら</span><span begin="3:42.060" end="3:43.020">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿望可以实现的话</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If I could have my wish to come true</span></p><p begin="3:43.250" end="3:46.380" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.250" end="3:43.530">何</span><span begin="3:43.530" end="3:43.730">度</span><span begin="3:43.730" end="3:43.960">で</span><span begin="3:43.960" end="3:44.420">も</span><span begin="3:44.690" end="3:44.800">生</span><span begin="3:44.800" end="3:44.930">ま</span><span begin="3:44.930" end="3:45.130">れ</span><span begin="3:45.130" end="3:45.360">変</span><span begin="3:45.360" end="3:45.570">わ</span><span begin="3:45.570" end="3:45.950">っ</span><span begin="3:46.090" end="3:46.380">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管要转世几次</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I&apos;d be born again and again</span></p><p begin="3:46.560" end="3:52.570" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:46.560" end="3:46.660">あ</span><span begin="3:46.660" end="3:46.740">の</span><span begin="3:46.740" end="3:47.020">日</span><span begin="3:47.020" end="3:47.300">の</span><span begin="3:47.470" end="3:47.990">君</span><span begin="3:47.990" end="3:48.230">に</span><span begin="3:48.440" end="3:48.660">逢</span><span begin="3:48.660" end="3:49.130">い</span><span begin="3:49.130" end="3:49.330">に</span><span begin="3:49.330" end="3:49.560">行</span><span begin="3:49.560" end="3:50.050">く</span><span begin="3:50.050" end="3:52.570">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会去找寻那时候的你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And go see you on those days</span></p></div><div begin="3:53.580" end="4:26.070" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="3:53.580" end="3:56.650" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:53.580" end="3:54.050">声</span><span begin="3:54.050" end="3:54.280">を</span><span begin="3:54.280" end="3:54.670">枯</span><span begin="3:54.670" end="3:55.120">ら</span><span begin="3:55.120" end="3:55.450">し</span><span begin="3:55.450" end="3:55.630">て</span><span begin="3:55.630" end="3:56.050">叫</span><span begin="3:56.050" end="3:56.390">ん</span><span begin="3:56.390" end="3:56.650">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喊叫到声嘶力竭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I screamed with my hoarse voice</span></p><p begin="3:56.860" end="4:00.830" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:56.860" end="3:57.310">反</span><span begin="3:57.310" end="3:57.780">響</span> <span begin="3:57.780" end="3:58.250">残</span><span begin="3:58.250" end="3:58.690">響</span> <span begin="3:58.690" end="3:59.110">空</span><span begin="3:59.110" end="3:59.430">し</span><span begin="3:59.430" end="3:59.640">く</span><span begin="3:59.640" end="4:00.350">響</span><span begin="4:00.350" end="4:00.830">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">反响 残响 空虚地响着</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Rebound and resonance echo in vain</span></p><p begin="4:01.050" end="4:04.560" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.050" end="4:01.500">外</span><span begin="4:01.500" end="4:01.680">さ</span><span begin="4:01.680" end="4:02.010">れ</span><span begin="4:02.010" end="4:02.230">た</span><span begin="4:02.230" end="4:02.960">鎖</span><span begin="4:02.960" end="4:03.200">の</span> <span begin="4:03.370" end="4:03.650">そ</span><span begin="4:03.650" end="4:03.850">の</span><span begin="4:03.850" end="4:04.360">先</span><span begin="4:04.360" end="4:04.560">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算把锁给解开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Nothing is left behind at the end</span></p><p begin="4:04.810" end="4:08.430" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:04.810" end="4:05.110">な</span><span begin="4:05.110" end="4:05.270">に</span><span begin="4:05.270" end="4:05.430">ひ</span><span begin="4:05.430" end="4:05.740">と</span><span begin="4:05.740" end="4:05.980">つ</span><span begin="4:05.980" end="4:06.380">残</span><span begin="4:06.380" end="4:06.670">っ</span><span begin="4:06.670" end="4:06.920">て</span><span begin="4:06.920" end="4:07.120">や</span><span begin="4:07.120" end="4:07.380">し</span><span begin="4:07.380" end="4:07.650">な</span><span begin="4:07.650" end="4:07.850">い</span><span begin="4:07.850" end="4:08.140">け</span><span begin="4:08.140" end="4:08.430">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也什么都不会留下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Of the me that has been unchained</span></p><p begin="4:08.560" end="4:11.670" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:08.560" end="4:08.810">ふ</span><span begin="4:08.810" end="4:09.090">た</span><span begin="4:09.090" end="4:09.300">り</span><span begin="4:09.300" end="4:09.500">を</span><span begin="4:09.500" end="4:10.210">繋</span><span begin="4:10.210" end="4:10.470">い</span><span begin="4:10.470" end="4:10.680">で</span><span begin="4:10.680" end="4:10.900">た</span><span begin="4:10.900" end="4:11.670">絆</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连结两人的羁绊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The bond between us had come apart</span></p><p begin="4:11.840" end="4:15.820" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:11.840" end="4:12.440">綻</span><span begin="4:12.440" end="4:12.660">び</span> <span begin="4:12.800" end="4:13.270">解</span><span begin="4:13.270" end="4:13.470">け</span> <span begin="4:13.470" end="4:13.860">日</span><span begin="4:13.860" end="4:14.470">常</span><span begin="4:14.470" end="4:14.640">に</span><span begin="4:14.640" end="4:14.800">消</span><span begin="4:14.800" end="4:15.140">え</span><span begin="4:15.140" end="4:15.340">て</span><span begin="4:15.340" end="4:15.820">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剪断 解开 消失在日常生活中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">And is dying away in everyday</span></p><p begin="4:15.990" end="4:19.620" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:15.990" end="4:16.290">さ</span><span begin="4:16.290" end="4:16.550">よ</span><span begin="4:16.550" end="4:16.680">な</span><span begin="4:16.680" end="4:16.970">ら</span><span begin="4:16.970" end="4:17.220">愛</span><span begin="4:17.220" end="4:17.480">し</span><span begin="4:17.480" end="4:17.600">た</span><span begin="4:17.600" end="4:18.200">人</span> <span begin="4:18.410" end="4:18.630">こ</span><span begin="4:18.630" end="4:18.900">こ</span><span begin="4:18.900" end="4:19.140">ま</span><span begin="4:19.140" end="4:19.380">で</span><span begin="4:19.380" end="4:19.620">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见了曾深爱的人 到此为止了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Goodbye, my sweetheart, it&apos;s over</span></p><p begin="4:19.810" end="4:26.070" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:19.810" end="4:20.050">も</span><span begin="4:20.050" end="4:20.260">う</span><span begin="4:20.260" end="4:20.430">振</span><span begin="4:20.430" end="4:20.760">り</span><span begin="4:20.760" end="4:20.980">向</span><span begin="4:20.980" end="4:21.230">か</span><span begin="4:21.230" end="4:21.390">な</span><span begin="4:21.390" end="4:21.690">い</span><span begin="4:21.690" end="4:21.930">で</span><span begin="4:22.140" end="4:22.630">歩</span><span begin="4:22.630" end="4:22.880">き</span><span begin="4:22.880" end="4:23.050">出</span><span begin="4:23.050" end="4:23.490">す</span><span begin="4:23.490" end="4:24.060">ん</span><span begin="4:24.060" end="4:26.070">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再回头就向前走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We had to leave without turning back</span></p></div><div begin="4:26.370" end="4:31.910" itunes:song-part="Outro"><p begin="4:26.370" end="4:31.910" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:26.370" end="4:26.660">こ</span><span begin="4:26.660" end="4:26.860">れ</span><span begin="4:26.860" end="4:27.030">で</span><span begin="4:27.030" end="4:27.250">お</span><span begin="4:27.250" end="4:27.550">し</span><span begin="4:27.550" end="4:27.840">ま</span><span begin="4:27.840" end="4:29.500">い</span><span begin="4:29.500" end="4:31.910">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此划下句点了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It&apos;s all over</span></p></div><div begin="4:27.550" end="4:54.840" itunes:song-part="Hook"><p begin="4:27.550" end="4:31.310" itunes:key="L70" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:27.550" end="4:27.830">Just</span> <span begin="4:27.830" end="4:28.020">be</span> <span begin="4:28.020" end="4:28.400">frien</span><span begin="4:28.400" end="4:28.510">ds</span><span begin="4:28.510" end="4:28.570">,</span> <span begin="4:29.430" end="4:29.550">i</span><span begin="4:29.550" end="4:29.640">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="4:29.640" end="4:30.100">time</span> <span begin="4:30.1